and\">Map of the island</span></h2>\n<figure class=\"thumb mw-halign-none show-info-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File/Thumb\" style=\"width: 188px\"> \t<a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/c/c5/Map_of_easter_island.jpg/revision/latest?cb=20250309155400\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"Map of easter island\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/c/c5/Map_of_easter_island.jpg/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/188?cb=20250309155400\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"188\" height=\"217\" class=\"thumbimage\" data-image-name=\"Map of easter island.jpg\" data-image-key=\"Map_of_easter_island.jpg\" data-relevant=\"1\" /></a> \t \t<figcaption class=\"thumbcaption\"> \t\t \t\t\t<a href=\"/wiki/File:Map_of_easter_island.jpg\" class=\"info-icon\"><svg><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-info-small\"></use></svg></a> \t\t \t\t \t\t \t</figcaption> </figure>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Trivia\">Trivia</span></h2>\n<ul><li>The Gigantic Moai is 46 studs tall and weighs 90 tons.</li>\n<li>You can get it in a single copy.</li>\n<li>He looks like a regular moai, only big in size and has a big smile.</li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Updates\">Updates</span></h2>\n<ul><li>On the Flight update (v112.0), The helicopter was able to winch the gigantic moai! This made transporting it ALOT easier.</li></ul>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260903131952\nCache expiry: 2592000\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [show‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.042 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.096 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 74/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 574/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 18/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 5/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 28/5000000 bytes\nLua time usage: 0.009/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 1019491/104857600 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)